  statement:"A belt driven pulley is decelerated from 1000 rpm with a constant angular acceleration of −30 rad/s². The belt runs on a sheave of 200 mm diameter. Find the acceleration of point C, the angular velocity of the pulley after 2 seconds, the velocity of point C after 2 seconds, the number of turns of the pulley between 0 and 2 seconds, and the time at which the pulley is not turning.",
